1612:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h **** /**
1613:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @param channel Pointer to USIC channel handler of type @ref XMC_USIC_CH_t \n
1614:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 				   \b Range: @ref XMC_USIC0_CH0, @ref XMC_USIC0_CH1 to @ref XMC_USIC2_CH1 based on device su
1615:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * @return Status of standard receive buffer, alternative receive buffer and receive buffer error e
1616:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 			\b Range: @ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_EVENT_STANDARD, @ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_EVENT_ERROR,
1617:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * 					  @ref XMC_USIC_CH_RXFIFO_EVENT_ALTERNATE.
