1754:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * Sets the USIC channel operation mode.\n\n
1755:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * A USIC channel can support multiple serial communication protocols like UART, SPI, I2C and I2S.
1756:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_usic.h ****  * The API sets the input operation mode to the USIC channel.
