  62:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** /**
  63:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @addtogroup XMClib XMC Peripheral Library
  64:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @{
  65:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  */
  66:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** 
  67:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** /**
  68:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @addtogroup SPI
  69:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @brief Synchronous serial channel driver for SPI-like communication.
  70:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * 
  71:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The SPI driver uses Universal Serial Interface Channel(USIC) module. 
  72:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * The USIC module supports multiple data lines for SPI communication. \n
  73:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Full duplex communication with 2 separate lines for transmission and reception.
  74:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Half duplex communication with 1 common line shared for transmission and reception.
  75:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Dual mode communication with 2 common lines shared for transmission and reception.
  76:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Quad mode communication with 4 common lines shared for transmission and reception.<br><br>
  77:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * 
  78:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * SPI driver provides structures, enumerations and APIs for configuring the USIC channel for SPI c
  79:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * and also for data transaction.<br>
  80:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * SPI driver features:
  81:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Configuration structure XMC_SPI_CH_CONFIG_t and SPI initialization function XMC_SPI_CH_Init()
  82:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Allows configuration of protocol word and frame length using XMC_SPI_CH_SetWordLength(), XMC_
  83:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Allows manipulation of data frame at runtime using XMC_SPI_CH_EnableSOF(), XMC_SPI_CH_EnableE
  84:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  XMC_SPI_CH_EnableSlaveSelect(), XMC_SPI_CH_DisableSlaveSelect()
  85:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Provides APIs for transmitting data and receiving data using XMC_SPI_CH_Transmit(), XMC_SPI_C
  86:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Allows configuration of shift clock using XMC_SPI_CH_ConfigureShiftClockOutput()
  87:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * -# Provides enumeration of SPI protocol events using @ref XMC_SPI_CH_STATUS_FLAG_t
  88:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @{
  89:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  */
  90:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** 
  91:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** /**************************************************************************************************
