 393:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** 
 394:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h **** /**
 395:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @param channel A constant pointer to XMC_USIC_CH_t, pointing to the USIC channel base address.
 396:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @param slave Slave select signal.\n
 397:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *              Refer @ref XMC_SPI_CH_SLAVE_SELECT_t for valid values.
 398:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *
 399:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * @return None
 400:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *
 401:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * \par<b>Description:</b><br>
 402:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * Enable the selected slave signal by setting PCR.SELO bits.\n\n
 403:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * Each slave is connected with one slave select signal. This is not configured in XMC_SPI_CH_Init(
 404:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * XMC_SPI_CH_EnableSlaveSelect() with required \a slave to to start the communication. After finis
 405:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  * communication XMC_SPI_CH_DisableSlaveSelect() can be invoked to disable the slaves.
 406:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_spi.h ****  *
